1
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,800
I heard

2
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,400
you arrested the palace painter,

3
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,660
Chu Qingyun, General.

4
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,680
To think he is a Northern spy.

5
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,840
You are truly well-informed, Duke.

6
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:06,820
Indeed.

7
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,960
I did find a peculiar painting

8
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,080
on Chu Qingyun.

9
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,880
It bears the emblem of an enemy spy ring.

10
00:01:16,039 --> 00:01:18,370
I actually buy his paintings quite often.

11
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,440
What does this emblem you speak of

12
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,570
look like, General?

13
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:25,000
Some things are better left unasked,

14
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,400
Duke.

15
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,640
How do you plan

16
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,570
to deal with Chu Qingyun, General?

17
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,520
I have tortured him

18
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,600
into confessing,

19
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,170
and he awaits execution in autumn.

20
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,960
Then this treason case will be closed.

21
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,580
There is no end to catching spies anyway.

22
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,039
I cannot waste all my time

23
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:47,520
on them.

24
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:48,690
Don't you agree,

25
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,560
Duke?

26
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,840
It seems Ning Yuanci

27
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,000
is really going to make a ruthless move

28
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,200
against Chu Qingyun.

29
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,680
And Xue Ruowan really

30
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:00,960
doesn't care about

31
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,890
Chu Qingyun's life or death at all.

32
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,000
You guys get to play both the heroes
and the villains.

33
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,880
I work so hard

34
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,600
saving this one and that one,

35
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,330
only to end up being the sucker.

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,200
It's all because of

37
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,600
this damn script system.

38
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,000
I don't even know

39
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,060
how to act anymore.

40
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,440
I just want to say,

41
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,560
what gives you the right
to represent the audience?

42
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,040
Why do I have to be at your mercy

43
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:29,970
just to survive?

44
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,400
Does this world really have to be

45
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,040
full of fighting and killing?

46
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,970
Can't there be a little truth,
goodness, and beauty?

47
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,400
Forget it.

48
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,120
If I change the main plot

49
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,840
and character settings without permission,

50
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,440
Xue Ruowan will be in danger.

51
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,079
But Chu Qingyun is the male lead.

52
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,480
If Ning Yuanci kills him,

53
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,280
I won't be able to

54
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:54,280
clear the game and reach the finale.

55
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,920
How can I make Ning Yuanci change his mind

56
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,560
without breaking

57
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,440
my evil woman persona?

58
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,040
I'll wait for you at Fengya Pavilion

59
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,900
in Wangyue Tower tomorrow night.

60
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:42,880
Brother Ning,

61
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,760
I knew you would come.

62
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,880
No matter how willful I am

63
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,140
or how much I anger you,

64
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,360
you still care about me,

65
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:50,920
right?

66
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,600
Didn't you say

67
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,560
your feelings for me were fake

68
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,360
and just an act?

69
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,240
What does it matter

70
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,370
if it's an act or not?

71
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,400
After all,

72
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,100
we are the same kind of people,

73
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,720
aren't we?

74
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,520
Why exactly did you ask me

75
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,880
to come here today?

76
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:21,850
Tomorrow

77
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,160
is your wedding night

78
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,360
with Xue Ruowan.

79
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,520
Of course I have to have you

80
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,680
before she does.

81
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,120
Isn't it a bit late

82
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,170
to try and please me now?

83
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,760
I said those things out of anger.

84
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,740
Xue Ruowan and Chu Qingyun

85
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,680
are in love.

86
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,370
Instead of letting them be,

87
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,760
you hold on to Chu Qingyun.

88
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,400
I thought

89
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,480
you had actually fallen for

90
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,520
Xue Ruowan.

91
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,440
So,

92
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,880
you're jealous.

93
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,170
I'm looking at the big picture.

94
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,380
It's fine if you marry Xue Ruowan.

95
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,940
But you must promise me

96
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,680
you won't touch her.

97
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,320
And it'd be best if you let Chu Qingyun

98
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,000
go,

99
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,760
so they can be together.

100
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,520
That's the only way to prove

101
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,680
you love me,

102
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:25,640
not her.

103
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,600
What if

104
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,640
I refuse?

105
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,980
Then I'll just have to drag you

106
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,240
to hell with me.

107
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,580
You want to kill me.

108
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,720
Just kidding.

109
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,760
In terms of martial arts,

110
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,360
how could I ever defeat Ning?

111
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,980
But what you didn't expect is that

112
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,640
I applied my mother's secret poison

113
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,240
on my lips.

114
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,760
If you don't want to die

115
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,600
from the poison with me tonight,

116
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,120
agree to my terms.

117
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,720
You just said

118
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,380
we are the same kind of people.

119
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,850
So it takes no effort

120
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,290
for me to see right through you.

121
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,400
Are you crazy?

122
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,920
Ning Yuanci,

123
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,880
didn't I tell you that

124
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,580
when you kill someone,

125
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,320
the heart is right here?

126
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,680
You want to be ruthless
but you can't bring yourself to do it.

127
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,480
You can't play the villain well.

128
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:06,040
Who wants to compete in acting with you?

129
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,360
You're so badly hurt.

130
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:11,480
Let's go find a doctor.

131
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,480
Don't actually die.

132
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,860
I've suffered this kind of injury

133
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,240
countless times on the battlefield.

134
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:19,940
I won't die.

135
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:21,640
But you,

136
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,360
don't get involved in things

137
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,400
you shouldn't.

138
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:26,860
Otherwise,

139
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,240
for the crimes of assassinating
the Defender General

140
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,760
and colluding with spies,

141
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,690
your Xue family couldn't pay for it

142
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,820
even if they died ten thousand times.

143
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,240
Strange.

144
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,500
Where is my bottle of Heartbreak Powder?

145
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,480
Oh no.

146
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,210
Could Ying'er have taken it

147
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:03,170
to deal with Xue Ruowan?

148
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,160
Mother. Ying'er.

149
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,840
There, there.

150
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:13,640
Don't cry.

151
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,120
Let me see.

152
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,160
A-Are

153
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,560
you hurt anywhere?

154
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,760
Let me see.

155
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,880
What happened?

156
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,720
What should I do?

157
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,049
Don't be afraid.

158
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:37,220
Even if you killed Xue Ruowan,

159
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,000
I would take the blame for you.

160
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,760
Actually, it's not Xue Ruowan.

161
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,640
She is perfectly fine.

162
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,040
W-

163
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,060
Weren't

164
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,280
you going to poison that good-for-nothing

165
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,720
Xue Ruowan?

166
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,320
I didn't even get to

167
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,920
use this Heartbreak Powder.

168
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:19,680
Wan'er, you are truly
as beautiful as a fairy.

169
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,000
Only you are worthy of

170
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,840
this imperially bestowed wedding dress.

171
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,720
Your daughter is getting married today.

172
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,380
I bid farewell to you, Father.

173
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:30,120
I know I owe you a lot.

174
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:31,960
You lost your mother at a young age

175
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,080
and suffered a lot.

176
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,280
But you have always been

177
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:36,280
the most obedient and sensible one.

178
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,520
I am very gratified

179
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,700
that you agreed to this marriage.

180
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,840
Father, you don't have
to pretend to be guilty

181
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,040
and say these things.

182
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,200
In the end,

183
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,640
it's just that you don't love me enough.

184
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,320
If you have to choose a daughter

185
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,720
to push into the fire pit,

186
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,120
it can only be me.

187
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,640
Do you want your sister

188
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,840
to go to her death?

189
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,040
Did you think

190
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,440
the assassins at the mansion

191
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,500
and your poisoning

192
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,800
were accidents?

193
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,080
It was all planned by Ning Yuanci.

194
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:10,080
He just wanted to frame me

195
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,000
for colluding with the Northern Frontier,

196
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,800
and then bring down our Xue family

197
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,660
in the name of eliminating spies.

198
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:19,040
If your sister hadn't accidentally

199
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,720
ruined his plan,

200
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,240
I would have been burdened with those

201
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:25,040
unwarranted charges long ago.

202
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:28,000
Then why did you still make me marry him?

203
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,120
Ning Yuanci is the Emperor's adopted son

204
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,980
and confidant.

205
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,720
Breaking the engagement

206
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,450
means disobeying His Majesty.

207
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,690
He wants you to marry him

208
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,520
just to have another hostage

209
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,720
in his hands.

210
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:43,680
Am I supposed to just sit
and wait for death?

211
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,130
I must take the initiative.

212
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,640
So,

213
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,800
Father, you mean to use me?

214
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,880
Ying'er is pure-hearted

215
00:10:58,160 --> 00:11:00,160
and deeply in love with Ning Yuanci.

216
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,240
She can't be ruthless.

217
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,480
But you can.

218
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,680
I am unfortunate

219
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,280
to have no sons.

220
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,840
I only have you two daughters.

221
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,880
Although I can't

222
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,250
treat you both equally,

223
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,920
I promise you...

224
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:26,080
I will do my best to keep you safe.

225
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,450
As we discussed,

226
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:31,760
poison Ning Yuanci on the wedding night.

227
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,200
I will send someone to coordinate with you

228
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,840
and help you fake your death to escape.
